---

### 4. `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Compiled binaries
/ted
/test_ted

# Object and header dependency files
src/*.o
src/*.d
tests/*.o
tests/*.d

# Atomic save temporary files
.ted.tmp.*

# Editor & OS artifacts
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# Debian & RPM packaging build outputs
/debian/ted/
/debian/.debhelper/
/debian/files
/debian/*.debhelper.log
/debian/*.substvars
/*.deb
/*.dsc
/*.tar.*
/*.buildinfo
/*.changes